docs/authentication.md
# Authentication

The API uses token based authentication using Laravel Sanctum.

## Login

Endpoint:
POST /api/login

Request Body:
{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}

Response:
{
  "token": "1|sdfkjsdfjsdf..."
}

Header for authenticated requests:
Authorization: Bearer {token}
docs/properties-api.md
# Properties API

## Get Properties

Endpoint:
GET /api/properties

Query Parameters:

search (string)
category_id (integer)
status (active/inactive)
min_price (number)
max_price (number)
sort_by (latest, oldest, price_low, price_high)
per_page (integer)

Example Request:

GET /api/properties?search=house&min_price=100000&max_price=500000&per_page=10

Example Response:

{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Luxury Villa",
      "price": 450000,
      "location": "Ahmedabad",
      "status": "active",
      "image_url": "http://localhost/storage/properties/villa.jpg",
      "category": {
        "id": 2,
        "name": "Villa"
      },
      "agent": {
        "id": 5,
        "name": "John Doe",
        "email": "john@example.com"
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": {
    "first": "...",
    "last": "...",
    "prev": null,
    "next": "..."
  },
  "meta": {
    "current_page": 1,
    "per_page": 10,
    "total": 120
  }
}
