docs/error-responses.md
# Error Responses

## Validation Error

Status Code:
422 Unprocessable Entity

Response:
{
  "message": "The given data was invalid.",
  "errors": {
    "title": [
      "The title field is required."
    ]
  }
}

## Unauthorized

Status Code:
401 Unauthorized

Response:
{
  "message": "Unauthenticated."
}

## Not Found

Status Code:
404 Not Found

Response:
{
  "message": "Resource not found."
}
docs/project-architecture.md
# Project Architecture

Framework:
Laravel 12

Architecture Pattern:
MVC (Model View Controller)

Directory Structure:

app/
  Http/
    Controllers/
    Requests/
    Middleware/
  Models/
  Jobs/
  Observers/
  Mail/

resources/
  views/

routes/
  web.php
  api.php

database/
  migrations/

public/
  assets/

Core Components:

Models
Represents database tables.

Controllers
Handle HTTP requests and business logic.

Requests
Validate API and form data.

Resources
Transform API responses.

Jobs
Handle background tasks like sending emails.

Observers
Handle model events and cache clearing.
docs/database-schema.md
# Database Schema

## users table

| Column | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| id | bigint | Primary key |
| name | varchar | User name |
| email | varchar | Email address |
| phone | varchar | Phone number |
| role | enum | admin / agent / user |
| password | varchar | Hashed password |

## properties table

| Column | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| id | bigint | Property ID |
| user_id | bigint | Agent ID |
| category_id | bigint | Category ID |
| title | varchar | Property title |
| description | text | Property details |
| price | decimal | Property price |
| location | varchar | Property location |
| status | enum | active / inactive |
| image | varchar | Image path |

## categories table

| Column | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| id | bigint | Category ID |
| name | varchar | Category name |
docs/deployment.md
# Deployment Guide

1 Install Dependencies

composer install

2 Copy Environment File

cp .env.example .env

3 Generate App Key

php artisan key:generate

4 Configure Database in .env

DB_DATABASE=real_estate
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=

5 Run Migrations

php artisan migrate

6 Start Server

php artisan serve
